@h1 Lists h1@

@h2 Bulleted h2@

@@@pre
@ul
@li Dunmore Head li@
@li Carrick Point li@
@li Fastnet Rock li@
ul@
pre@@@

@h2 Numbered h2@

Swap @code ul code@ for @code ol code@:

@@@pre
@ol
@li Light the lamp li@
@li Trim the wick li@
@li Log the weather li@
ol@
pre@@@

@h2 Definition lists h2@

Pair terms with their descriptions:

@@@pre
@dl
@dt Keeper dt@
@dd Tends the light and keeps the log. dd@
@dt Relief dt@
@dd Stands in when the keeper is ashore. dd@
dl@
pre@@@

An @code li code@ can hold rich content — more prose, emphasis, even a nested
list — not just a single line.
